From: OpenBMC Orange Pi maintainers <openbmc@example.invalid>
Subject: pylibfdt: use setuptools after distutils removal

Python 3.12 and later no longer provide distutils.  The U-Boot 2021.10
pylibfdt helper only needs setup and Extension, both of which are provided
by setuptools on the build host.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [version-specific OpenBMC integration]

---
 scripts/dtc/pylibfdt/setup.py | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/scripts/dtc/pylibfdt/setup.py b/scripts/dtc/pylibfdt/setup.py
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/scripts/dtc/pylibfdt/setup.py
+++ b/scripts/dtc/pylibfdt/setup.py
@@ -18,7 +18,10 @@
     ./pylibfdt/setup.py install [--prefix=...]
 """

-from distutils.core import setup, Extension
+try:
+    from setuptools import setup, Extension
+except ImportError:
+    from distutils.core import setup, Extension
 import os
 import re
 import sys
